abstract: >-
  The Quran Vision Corpus (v6.2.2), founded and authored by Mehmet Yarıcı (ORCID: 0009-0003-0356-8582; Uludağ University Faculty of Theology / Republic of Türkiye Ministry of National Education), is a bilingual (Turkish/English) academic research corpus and interactive digital cockpit comprising 15 foundational Quranic verse monographs (QV-2026-001 through QV-2026-015) and 33 A4 PDF documents. v6.2.2: Complete Irfani/Sufi Hermeneutics Reform across 15 monographs (Step 13), 100% verbatim classical Arabic quotes with exact page_id Shamela links, comprehensive Hadith/Ayat/Ulama tahrij in body text, addition of 33rd document (ISNAD-2 Classical Arabic Databases Guide authored by Mehmet Yarıcı), and compiled master corpus books. External Academic Advisor & Peer-Reviewer: Mehmet Emin Koç (ORCID: 0000-0002-1025-5643; Azerbaijan National Academy of Sciences, Institute of Philosophy and Sociology).
